Package: qt-wayland-gl-smoke
Version: @DEB_QT_WAYLAND_GL_SMOKE_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Development
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://repo.maxleiter.com/
Depends: qt6-base (>= 6.6.3-3), qt6-wayland (>= 6.6.3-1), angle (>= 2.1.0+git20260630.a32d31d+es3-3), libwayland0, ldid
Description: Qt Wayland OpenGL smoke test for Xios
 Tiny QtGui/OpenGL executable that defaults to the Wayland QPA plugin and
 renders through QtWayland EGL. It is intended to validate the
 QtWayland -> ANGLE/Metal -> IOSurface path without pulling in Plasma.
